		{"id":"gr-Chat (planejado)","type":"group","x":1400,"y":1904,"width":1140,"height":622,"label":"Chat (planejado)"},
		{"id":"tb-animals","type":"text","text":"## animals\n\n| coluna | tipo | chave |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **id** | bigint | PK |\n| user_id | bigint | FK users |\n| name | varchar(60) | nulo |\n| species | enum |  |\n| breed | varchar(60) | nulo |\n| sex | enum |  |\n| size | enum |  |\n| color | enum |  |\n| distinctive_features | text | nulo |\n| approximate_birth_date | date | nulo |\n| vaccinated | boolean | nulo |\n| dewormed | boolean | nulo |\n| neutered | boolean | nulo |\n\n**species:** dog, cat, bird, rodent, rabbit, other  \n**sex:** male, female, undefined  \n**size:** small, medium, large  \n**color:** black, white, gray, caramel, golden, orange, brown, beige, black_and_white, brindle, tricolor, siamese, other  \n+ timestamps e soft deletes  ","x":520,"y":952,"width":420,"height":802,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"tb-posts","type":"text","text":"## posts\n\n| coluna | tipo | chave |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **id** | bigint | PK |\n| user_id | bigint | FK users |\n| animal_id | bigint | FK animals |\n| type | enum |  |\n| title | varchar(120) |  |\n| description | text |  |\n| status | enum |  |\n| municipality_id | int | FK municipalities |\n| occurred_at | date | nulo |\n| location_reference | varchar(120) | nulo |\n| with_finder | boolean | nulo |\n| published_at | timestamp | nulo |\n| approved_by | bigint | FK users, nulo |\n| approved_at | timestamp | nulo |\n\n**type:** adoption, lost, found  \n**status:** pending_approval, rejected, active, paused, expired, resolved, canceled  \n+ timestamps e soft deletes  \nVer [[Fluxo Status de Anuncio]] e [[Tipos Anuncio]].  ","x":1040,"y":952,"width":420,"height":784,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"tb-post_files","type":"text","text":"## post_files\n\n| coluna | tipo | chave |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **id** | bigint | PK |\n| post_id | bigint | FK posts (cascade) |\n| path | varchar(255) |  |\n| disk | varchar(30) |  |\n| hash | char(64) |  |\n| size | int |  |\n| mime_type | varchar(100) |  |\n| position | smallint | padrão 0 |\n\n+ timestamps e soft deletes  ","x":1560,"y":952,"width":420,"height":476,"color":"#1b3083"},
		{"id":"tb-moderations","type":"text","text":"## moderations\n\n| coluna | tipo | chave |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **id** | bigint | PK |\n| post_id | bigint | FK posts (cascade) |\n| moderator_id | bigint | FK users |\n| action | enum |  |\n| reason | text | nulo |\n| created_at | timestamp |  |\n\n*Planejado: ainda sem rotas na API.*  \n**action:** approval, rejection  \nHistórico: só recebe inserções.  ","x":2080,"y":952,"width":420,"height":460,"color":"#7a1f6b"},
		{"id":"tb-favorites","type":"text","text":"## favorites\n\n| coluna | tipo | chave |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **user_id** | bigint | PK, FK users (cascade) |\n| **post_id** | bigint | PK, FK posts (cascade) |\n| created_at | timestamp |  |\n\nNão é possível favoritar o próprio anúncio.  ","x":0,"y":952,"width":420,"height":306,"color":"#8a5a00"},
		{"id":"tb-reviews","type":"text","text":"## reviews\n\n| coluna | tipo | chave |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **id** | bigint | PK |\n| adoption_id | bigint | FK adoptions |\n| reviewer_id | bigint | FK users |\n| reviewee_id | bigint | FK users |\n| rating | tinyint |  |\n| comment | text |  |\n\n*Planejado: criar avaliação ainda sem rota na API; a leitura no perfil já existe.*  \nÚnico (adoption_id, reviewer_id). Nota de 1 a 5; ninguém avalia a si mesmo.  \n+ timestamps  ","x":0,"y":1974,"width":420,"height":512,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"tb-messages","type":"text","text":"## messages\n\n| coluna | tipo | chave |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **id** | bigint | PK |\n| conversation_id | bigint | FK conversations (cascade) |\n| sender_id | bigint | FK users (cascade) |\n| body | text |  |\n| read_at | timestamp | nulo |\n\n*Planejado: ainda sem rotas na API.*  \n+ timestamps e soft deletes  ","x":2080,"y":1974,"width":420,"height":400,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"mu07b3c4d5e6f70a","type":"file","file":"02-Modelagem/Busca por Proximidade.md","x":-560,"y":-760,"width":440,"height":600,"color":"#2d6a4f"},
