		{"id":"tb-adoptions","type":"text","text":"## adoptions\n\n| coluna | tipo | chave |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **id** | bigint | PK |\n| post_id | bigint | FK posts |\n| adopter_id | bigint | FK users |\n| status | enum |  |\n| completed_at | timestamp | nulo |\n| locked_post_id | bigint | UK, gerada |\n\n**status:** in_progress, completed, refused, canceled  \nlocked_post_id: no máximo uma adoção in_progress ou completed por anúncio.  \n+ timestamps  \nVer [[Fluxo Status de Adocao]].  ","x":620,"y":1974,"width":420,"height":538,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"tb-conversations","type":"text","text":"## conversations\n\n| coluna | tipo | chave |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **id** | bigint | PK |\n| post_id | bigint | FK posts (cascade) |\n| advertiser_id | bigint | FK users (cascade) |\n| interested_id | bigint | FK users (cascade) |\n| status | enum |  |\n| last_message_at | timestamp | nulo |\n\n*Planejado: ainda sem rotas na API.*  \n**status:** active, archived, blocked  \nÚnico (post_id, interested_id): uma conversa por interessado em cada anúncio.  \n+ timestamps  ","x":1440,"y":1974,"width":420,"height":512,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"tb-municipalities","type":"text","text":"## municipalities\n\n| coluna | tipo | chave |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **ibge_code** | int | PK |\n| name | varchar(100) |  |\n| state | char(2) |  |\n| latitude | decimal(9,6) |  |\n| longitude | decimal(9,6) |  |\n\nTabela de referência só de leitura (5571 municípios do IBGE), sem timestamps.  \nVer [[Busca por Proximidade]].  ","x":420,"y":0,"width":420,"height":426,"color":"#2d6a4f"},
		{"id":"tb-users","type":"text","text":"## users\n\n| coluna | tipo | chave |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **id** | bigint | PK |\n| name | varchar(255) |  |\n| email | varchar(255) | UK |\n| phone | varchar(20) | nulo |\n| bio | varchar(500) | nulo |\n| avatar_path | varchar(255) | nulo |\n| email_verified_at | timestamp | nulo |\n| password | varchar(255) |  |\n| municipality_id | int | FK municipalities |\n| role | enum |  |\n| status | enum |  |\n| remember_token | varchar(100) | nulo |\n| last_login_at | timestamp | nulo |\n| anonymized_at | timestamp | nulo |\n\n**role:** admin, user  \n**status:** active, suspended, banned  \n+ timestamps  ","x":1140,"y":0,"width":420,"height":732,"color":"6"}
	],
